# Docs workflow triggers (thin)

On matching user intent, **state the recommended workflow in 2–4 lines** and point to `docs/ai/templates/` before large code edits.

| Intent (examples) | Propose |
|-------------------|---------|
| 计划、路线图、优先级、roadmap | Re-read `ENGINE_DESIGN_PHILOSOPHY.md` + `ENGINE_CAPABILITY_ROADMAP.md`; Check `FEATURE_REGISTRY`; Roadmap or Implementation Plan; register `<DOMAIN>-Fnn` before use；提醒多轨并行、勿线性清空 TODO |
| 设计、方案、架构、怎么实现 | Register Feature → Design Spec → Implementation Plan; **mentor Pre-flight** before big code |
| 新模块、新功能、开始做 X（ substantial ） | **Pre-flight** (deps, debt, WIP, Go/Defer) per `engine-learning-mentor` |
| 重构、refactor、重写、理顺、整理架构 | Same as new feature: Registry + Design/REFACTOR plan + **Pre-flight**; **true refactor** not band-aid (mentor § Refactoring discipline) |
| 别模块 bug、顺手修、改 B 模块（当前在做 A） | File `BUG-*` first; no drive-by fix unless user overrides (mentor § Defects) |
| handoff、交接、换会话、下次继续 | Session note + `PROGRESS_LOG`; Blocked + Status note if slice incomplete (§DOC_GOVERNANCE §9.1) |
| 发现 bug、崩溃、回归、修不了 | Bug Record (`bug-record.template.md`); `BUG-<DOMAIN>-nnn` |
| 改设计、方案变更、推翻 | Revise Design + changelog; major trade-off → ADR |
| 做完、收尾、这轮结束、slice 完成 | Slice DoD + `PROGRESS_LOG`; then **propose 准备 commit** before unrelated next work (§7.4 / mentor Work boundary) |
| Agent 完成一批 docs/rules/多文件改动 | Same: DoD + Progress → **offer 准备 commit**; do not jump to new Feature implementation |
| 准备 commit、准备提交、写提交信息 | **git-commit-mentor**: draft message + **wait for approval** — not `git commit` unless user explicitly approves execution |

**Not every message:** tiny fixes / pure questions — one-line reminder at most; skip if user says no docs.

**Authority:** `DOC_GOVERNANCE.md` (IDs, DoD). **Execution:** `engine-learning-mentor` (Documentation collaboration, Pre-flight, Refactoring discipline, Partner stance, Defects).
